4090 1097 3856 Q 960 3622 960 3328 Q 960 3059 1085 2838 Q 1210 2618 1434 2490 Q 1658 2362 1965 2362 L 1965 2362 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/></defs><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-85\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-a9\" transform=\"translate(65.40625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-89\" transform=\"translate(86.3125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-80\" transform=\"translate(152.109375 0)\"/></g></g></g></g><defs><clipPath id=\"p66d99087cf\"><rect x=\"35.299719\" y=\"11.088\" width=\"345.96\" height=\"121.968\"/></clipPath></defs></svg>\n","title":"Exhibit 1 · Yearly revenue ($M)","note":null},"answer":"<p><b>Commuters (before 10am, all day): $24</b>, about 650 spaces.</p> <p><b>Short stays (after 10am, up to 4 hours): $16</b>, about 300 cars; two can share a space, so they need about 150 spaces. 650 + 150 = 800.</p> <p><b>Evening (after 6pm): $8</b>, about 400 cars.</p> <p>Revenue: (650 × $24 + 300 × $16 + 400 × $8) × 250 = <b>$5.9M</b>, +24%.</p>"},{"q":"What could go wrong?","exhibit":null,"answer":"<ul><li>Commuters may resent paying $24; offer monthly passes at a small discount for loyalty</li><li>Need space-availability signs and an app so short-stay visitors know there's room</li> <li>Check local rules on evening charges and nearby residents' concerns</li></ul>"}],"reco":"Charge by time of day: $24 for all-day commuters, $16 for short stays after 10am, and $8 in the evening. Reserving about 150 spaces for short-stay visitors, who can share a space across the day, and filling the empty evenings raises revenue from $4.75M to about $5.9M a year (+24%). Offer monthly passes to keep regular commuters. Risk: commuters switching to rival car parks. Next step: install availability signs and test prices for three months.","great":["Sees time as the scarce resource","Segments users by when and how long they park","Checks the plan fits capacity","Keeps loyal commuters with passes"],"id":97,"slug":"gateway-parking"}